  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/29VEnDg.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"482\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZWKmEPkPd7Xt8fkKVeBzTQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCZWKmEPkPd7Xt8fkKVeBzTQ?color=9a7daa&logo=youtube&style=for-the-badge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fizofar%252fbastille-blues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/plays-4.8k-594058?logo=soundcloud&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/izofar43\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/followers-39-9a7daa?logo=twitter&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/izofar/bygone-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/izofar/takes-a-pillage?color=594058&label=license&logo=github&style=for-the-badge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/it-takes-a-pillage/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/version-1.0.3-9a7daa?label=Version&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/it-takes-a-pillage-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/op4tPpo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"99\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>一款適用於 1.16.5+ 的掠奪者模組，旨在擴展掠奪者文明，並為生存模式提供更多挑戰與引人入勝的玩法。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>掠奪者已擴張其文明！他們在全世界設立了營地與堡壘！你有能力克服這些新威脅，並奪取他們的珍貴戰利品嗎？劇透內容請見圖片標籤頁！</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>It Takes a Pillage</strong> 目前已正式發行！這是我的第二個已發佈模組。歡迎瀏覽我的其他作品，並留意更多新作！可至 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsoundcloud.com%252fizofar%252fbastille-blues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SoundCloud</a> 聆聽音樂原聲帶。<strong>請考慮在下方支持我，這將讓我更有時間進行更新與修復。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hv904uC.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>💸 捐贈與支持</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:36px;margin-right:60px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fizofar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/XbR4s64.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"280\"></a><a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bygone-nether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Q1csRkp.png\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hv904uC.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🎥 影片：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ElrvaNwvEHs\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hv904uC.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>❗&nbsp;</strong><strong>前置模組：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/b1sKEDp.png\" width=\"73\" height=\"31\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.19.2.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/NFDhQUd.png\" width=\"146\" height=\"31\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ek7ODYh.png\" width=\"73\" height=\"31\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.18.2.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ZVo2Y5w.png\" width=\"146\" height=\"31\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmJfA0d.png\" width=\"73\" height=\"31\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.16.5.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/LK6Yi7Q.png\" width=\"146\" height=\"31\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">無需任何其他模組！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📦 與其他模組的整合：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/b1sKEDp.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"31\">&nbsp;</span><a style=\"font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O'Plenty,</a> <a style=\"font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a>,&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ek7ODYh.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"31\">&nbsp;</span><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O'Plenty<del></del></a>,&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a>,&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmJfA0d.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"31\">&nbsp;</span><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O'Plenty</a>,&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🕷&nbsp;<strong>於下方回報錯誤</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/izofar/takes-a-pillage\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api/pin/?username=izofar&repo=takes-a-pillage&title_color=ffd556&text_color=eee&bg_color=000&icon_color=9a7daa\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\">✔️&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>舊問題修復</strong></span> (&nbsp;<em>tldr</em>：只需更新 Bygone Nether 與 Forge ):</span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/q3l2bNb.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"31\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問題：</strong>鐵魔像的召喚指令失效；<strong>修復：</strong>將模組更新至 v1.0.2 或更新版本</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問題：</strong>黏土魔像大量爆炸；<strong>修復：</strong>將模組更新至 v1.0.2 或更新版本</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/b1sKEDp.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"31\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問題：</strong>飲用牛奶時遊戲當機；<strong>修復：</strong>將模組更新至 v1.0.1 或更新版本</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ek7ODYh.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"31\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>目前尚無針對 1.18.2 的特定錯誤修復</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/JmJfA0d.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"31\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>目前尚無針對 1.16.5 的特定錯誤修復</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🤍&nbsp;<strong>致謝：</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特別感謝來自模組開發 Discord 的 <a href=\"https://github.com/TelepathicGrunt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telepathic Grunt</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/SizableShrimp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sizable Shrimp</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/Commoble\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Commoble</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Cadiboo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cadiboo</a>，感謝他們在開發過程中提供的協助與指導。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特別感謝 ZestyBlaze 完成《It Takes a Pillage》的初始 Fabric 移植！</span></p>",
